h2 { font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 8px; } ul { margin: 4px 0 10px; padding-left: 20px; } li { margin-bottom: 3px; }
</style>
<h2>Asobi 0.9 (build 775)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Anamorphic desqueeze, everywhere.</b> The layout grid, the filmstrip and the playlist&#8217;s thumbnails now show a desqueezed clip at its true shape, and so does the web review page &#8212; live, so changing the factor mid-review updates every open page, with marks staying on their features in both directions. The shared proxy itself stays as recorded.</li>
<li>On the web, a parked full-resolution still no longer hides the difference view when a compare starts.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
